source: touchpad-045e-09af.caps
measured: 2026-10-26
note: SYNTHESIZED from HidP capabilities, not the device's raw descriptor
top_level: 0xd/0x5
descriptor_bytes: 427
computed_inlen: 30
computed_outlen: 0
computed_featlen: 34
caps_inlen: 30
caps_outlen: 0
caps_featlen: 34
assumption: only HidP capabilities were available: no raw descriptor, no item order, no collection types, no flags
assumption: Button caps carry no size or range: every Button is 1 bit with logical 0..1 and no physical range
assumption: all value fields are Data,Variable,Absolute (0x02); padding items are Constant,Variable (0x03)
assumption: the Report ID is declared inside the top-level collection, before the first field of each report
assumption: logical and physical numbers use minimal signed 1/2/4 byte encodings; unit exponent and unit are the raw HidP values (nibble 14 = -2, 12 = -4, 0 = 0; unit 0x11 = cm, 0x1001 = s)
assumption: physical/unit globals are only emitted for Value caps and are inherited by Button fields
assumption: collection types are assumed: top-level Application, Finger/Device Settings Logical, Stylus Physical
assumption: finger collection order: Confidence at bit 0, Tip Switch at bit 1 (Windows Precision Touchpad sample descriptor; the task text listed Tip first; switch via FINGER_BIT_ORDER in layouts.py)
assumption: finger collections are Logical collections of usage Finger (0x0d/0x22); HidP exposes only the link index
assumption: padding after Contact ID aligns each finger block to a byte boundary
assumption: top-level item order: Scan Time, Contact Count, Button 1 + padding, then feature reports
assumption: feature rid 4 packs Contact Count Maximum (0x55) low nibble and usage 0x59 (Pad Type in HID Usage Tables 1.3; the task text calls it Surface Switch) high nibble; caps list 0x59 first, the order follows the Microsoft sample descriptor
assumption: feature rid 6 Latency Mode (0x60) is padded to a byte
assumption: vendor feature rid 5 uses usage page 0xff00, usages 0xc6 (1 byte) and 0xc7 (32 bytes) as two items
assumption: physical min/max/unit of Button, Scan Time, Contact Count and feature fields are copied from the caps; the values 0..65535 / exponent -4 / seconds on non-time fields are an inherited HidP artifact
